<div class="shell">
 <aside class="sidebar">
  <div class="brand"><span class="seal" lang="ja" aria-hidden="true">百首</span><div><div class="brand-name">百人一首</div><div class="eyebrow">Hyakunin Isshu · 100 Poems</div></div></div>
  <nav class="nav" aria-label="主要导航"><button data-view="study" aria-current="page"><span class="nav-num">01</span>学习手帖</button><button data-view="library"><span class="nav-num">02</span>百首索引</button><button data-view="practice"><span class="nav-num">03</span>配对练习</button><button data-view="guide"><span class="nav-num">04</span>入门指南</button></nav>
  <div class="sidebar-bottom"><p class="side-quote">小倉百人一首</p><div class="progress-copy"><span>已记住</span><span id="learnedCount">0 / 100</span></div><div class="progress-track" role="progressbar" aria-label="已记住的诗歌" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" id="progress"><div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div></div><p class="local-label">学习记录保存在本浏览器</p></div>
 </aside>
 <main id="main" class="main" tabindex="-1">
  <div class="topline"><span>小倉百人一首 / 中文学习手帖</span><span class="edition">一百首诗 · 从七张开始</span></div>
  <div id="storageWarning" class="storage-warning" hidden>浏览器无法保存记录；本次仍可学习，关闭后记录可能丢失。</div>
  <section id="study" class="page-view" aria-labelledby="studyTitle">
   <div class="page-heading"><div><h1 id="studyTitle">歌牌学习</h1><p>先认识决字，再把上句与下句连起来。</p></div><button class="little-action" data-go="guide">初次接触歌牌 ↗</button></div>
   <div class="study-tools"><label class="field-inline">学习范围 <select id="studyPool"><option value="starter">七张一字决 · 入门</option><option value="all">百首全览</option><option value="favorites">我的收藏</option><option value="review">错题复习</option><option value="unlearned">尚未记住</option></select></label><label class="check"><input id="kanaToggle" type="checkbox" checked>显示读音</label></div>
   <div id="studyContent"></div>
   <div class="study-strip"><div class="section-label"><span>起步七张 / むすめふさほせ</span><button class="little-action" id="practiceStarter">练一轮 →</button></div><div class="starter-chips" id="starterChips"></div><p class="study-strip-note">这七首只听第一个音，就能确定是哪张札。</p></div>
  </section>
  <section id="library" class="page-view" aria-labelledby="libraryTitle" hidden>
   <div class="page-heading"><div><h1 id="libraryTitle">百首索引</h1><p>按决字分组记忆，也可以从喜欢的诗开始。</p></div></div>
   <div class="filter-bar"><label>搜索诗句、作者、读音或编号<input type="search" id="search" placeholder="例如：ちはや、秋、紫式部、17" autocomplete="off"></label><label>初始决字<select class="select" id="lengthFilter"><option value="all">全部长度</option><option value="1">一字决 · 7首</option><option value="2">二字决 · 42首</option><option value="3">三字决 · 37首</option><option value="4">四字决 · 6首</option><option value="5">五字决 · 2首</option><option value="6">六字决 · 6首</option></select></label><label>学习状态<select class="select" id="statusFilter"><option value="all">全部诗歌</option><option value="favorites">我的收藏</option><option value="learned">已记住</option><option value="unlearned">尚未记住</option><option value="review">错题复习</option></select></label></div>
   <p id="searchCount" class="search-count" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="catalog" class="catalog"></div>
  </section>
  <section id="practice" class="page-view" aria-labelledby="practiceTitle" hidden>
   <div class="page-heading"><div><h1 id="practiceTitle">配对练习</h1><p>不急着抢札。先把每一个开头，连到正确的下句。</p></div></div>
   <div id="practiceContent"></div>
  </section>
  <section id="guide" class="page-view rules" aria-labelledby="guideTitle" hidden>
   <div class="page-heading"><div><h1 id="guideTitle">入门指南</h1><p>本手帖学习日本「小倉百人一首」歌牌。</p></div></div>
   <div class="rule-lead"><div><h2>听上句，找下句。</h2><p>读札写全歌，取札只写下句。记忆的核心，是让开头的声音唤起对应的取札。</p></div><div class="syllables" aria-label="上句五七五，下句七七"><span><b>5</b>上</span><span><b>7</b>句</span><span><b>5</b>音</span><span aria-hidden="true">／</span><span class="lower"><b>7</b>下</span><span class="lower"><b>7</b>句</span></div></div>
   <details open><summary>01　先记七张一字决</summary><div class="rule-content"><p>和歌通常分为五・七・五・七・七，前三句为上句，后两句为下句。<strong>决字（決まり字）</strong>是从开头听到足以辨认该首的最短部分，初始长度为 1–6 音。</p><p>先用「<strong lang="ja">むすめふさほせ</strong>」记住七张一字决：む 87、す 18、め 57、ふ 22、さ 70、ほ 81、せ 77。每天先认下句，再看决字回想对应的札。</p><p><button class="btn small" id="guideStart">从这七张开始 →</button></p></div></details>
   <details><summary>02　友札：相似开头，要一起记</summary><div class="rule-content"><p>开头相同的札称为「友札」。留意声音从哪里开始分开：</p><div class="comparison"><span class="example" lang="ja">あき<em>の</em></span><span class="example" lang="ja">あき<em>か</em></span></div><p>第 1 首「秋の田の」与第 79 首「秋風に」都以「あき」起头，听到第 3 音才能区分。记忆时把决字与<strong>下句开头</strong>配成一组。</p><p>决字会随已读诗歌改变。例如「はるすぎて」读过后，「はるのよの」只听「はる」便能确定。判断时仍要考虑尚未读出的空札。本手帖展示的是<strong>初始决字</strong>。</p></div></details>
   <details><summary>03　正式竞技如何进行</summary><div class="rule-content"><p>两人各随机取 25 张取札，场上共 50 张；摆好后有 15 分钟暗记时间。读手从 100 首中逐首读出，未摆出的 50 张叫<strong>空札</strong>。先清空自阵的一方获胜。</p><p>取走对方阵中的出札后，可从自阵送 1 张给对方。对方犯规时也可按规则送札。</p><p><strong>お手つき（犯规）</strong>涉及触碰没有出札的阵内札；空札时两阵都不能碰。碰到出札所在阵的其他札，本身不算这项犯规。本页四选一“答错”是记忆反馈，不等同于正式比赛的犯规判定。</p><p><a href="https://www.karuta.or.jp/karuta/rule/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看全日本かるた協会正式规则 ↗</a></p></div></details>
   <details><summary>04　原文、假名和声音怎样一起学</summary><div class="rule-content"><p>诗歌原文保留古典表达；上方小字和「下句读音」给出读音辅助。卡面采用传统假名，按竞技取札式样省略浊点。读音辅助栏保留浊点，便于辨读。</p><p>写法与声音可能不同，例如「めぐりあひて」读作「めぐりあいて」，「てふ」读作「ちょう」。不要按现代字面机械拼读古典假名。</p><p>“朗读”调用设备的日语合成语音，用于辅助记忆，<strong>不是公认读手录音</strong>，也不复现正式比赛节奏。设备没有日语声音时，可改用文字练习。</p><p><a href="https://www.karuta.or.jp/karuta/reading/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">学习协会的正式读唱方法 ↗</a></p></div></details>
   <details><summary>05　建议学习路线与记录说明</summary><div class="rule-content"><p><strong>第一步：</strong>七张一字决逐张揭晓，记住下句。<strong>第二步：</strong>用“决字找下句”检验。<strong>第三步：</strong>扩展到二字决与友札。<strong>第四步：</strong>加入听音与实体札位置记忆。</p><p>每轮最多 10 题，不重复出题；选项优先来自所选范围，不足四首时从百首补齐干扰项。答错会加入错题复习，之后首次答对该首可移出错题。主动点“记住了”才计入已记住，答对一次不会自动视为掌握。</p><p>收藏、已记住与错题仅保存在当前浏览器。可以导出备份并在本页重新导入。</p><div class="action-group" style="flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px"><button class="btn small" id="exportProgress">导出学习记录</button><button class="btn small" id="importProgress">导入学习记录</button><button class="btn small" id="resetProgress">清空学习记录</button><input type="file" id="importFile" accept="application/json,.json" hidden></div></div></details>
   <details><summary>06　资料来源与文本说明</summary><div class="rule-content"><p>原诗属公版古典文学；中文为本手帖编写的简短意译，用于理解与记忆，不代替完整注释。决字按全 100 首均未读出的状态标示。主题仅作学习归类。</p><ol class="source-list" id="sourceList"></ol><p>第 74 首采用竞技读诵的「山おろし」，文学版本常作「山おろしよ」。读音栏保留助词 は／を 的常见写法，实际分别读 wa／o。核对日期：2026 年 10 月 4 日。网页练习简化为辨认下句，未模拟送札、空札、场地动作和变化决字。</p></div></details>
  </section>
  <footer class="bottom-note"><span>百人一首 · 原文 · 决字 · 配对练习</span><button data-go="guide">使用说明与来源</button></footer>
 </main>
</div>
<div class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" id="toast" hidden></div>
<script id="poemData" type="application/json">__POEMS_JSON__</script>
<script id="sourceData" type="application/json">__SOURCES_JSON__</script>
<script>
'use strict';
const poems=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('poemData').textContent);
const byId=new Map(poems.map(p=>[p.id,p]));
const STARTERS=[87,18,57,22,70,81,77], STORE='ichion-karuta-v1';
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s), $$=s=>Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(s));
const esc=s=>String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const cleanIds=a=>Array.isArray(a)?[...new Set(a.filter(x=>Number.isInteger(x)&&byId.has(x)))]:[];
function cleanState(o){if(!o||typeof o!=='object')return {learned:[],favorites:[],review:[],kana:true};return {learned:cleanIds(o.learned),favorites:cleanIds(o.favorites),review:cleanIds(o.review),kana:o.kana!==false};}
let memory=cleanState(null), storageOK=true;
try{memory=cleanState(JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORE)||'null'));}catch{storageOK=false;}
let currentView='study', studyScope='starter', currentId=STARTERS[0], revealed=false, quiz=null, toastTimer;
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(STORE,JSON.stringify(memory));storageOK=true;}catch{storageOK=false;}$('#storageWarning').hidden=storageOK;updateProgress();}
function updateProgress(){$('#learnedCount').textContent=memory.learned.length+' / 100';$('#progressFill').style.width=memory.learned.length+'%';$('#progress').setAttribute('aria-valuenow',memory.learned.length);}
function notify(message){$('#toast').textContent=message;$('#toast').hidden=false;clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').hidden=true,3800);}
function toggleRecord(key,id){memory[key]=memory[key].includes(id)?memory[key].filter(n=>n!==id):[...memory[key],id];save();}
function getPool(scope){if(scope==='starter')return STARTERS.map(id=>byId.get(id));if(scope==='unlearned')return poems.filter(p=>!memory.learned.includes(p.id));if(['favorites','review','learned'].includes(scope))return poems.filter(p=>memory[scope].includes(p.id));return poems;}
function stopAudio(){if('speechSynthesis'in window)window.speechSynthesis.cancel();}
function setView(view,focus=true){stopAudio();document.body.classList.remove('is-quizzing');currentView=view;for(const el of $$('.page-view'))el.hidden=el.id!==view;for(const el of $$('.nav button')){if(el.dataset.view===view)el.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else el.removeAttribute('aria-current');}if(view==='study')renderStudy();if(view==='library')renderCatalog();if(view==='practice'){quiz=null;renderPracticeConfig();}if(focus){window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'});$('#main').focus({preventScroll:true});}}
function cardMarkup(p){const str=(p.historical||p.kana).slice(3).join('').normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u3099\u309a\s]/g,'').normalize('NFC');const chars=Array.from(str);return '<div class="karuta"><div class="card-text" lang="ja" aria-label="'+esc(str)+'">'+[chars.slice(0,5),chars.slice(5,10),chars.slice(10)].filter(a=>a.length).map(a=>'<span class="card-column" aria-hidden="true">'+esc(a.join(''))+'</span>').join('')+'</div></div>';}
function lineMarkup(p,indices){return '<div class="reading-card" lang="ja">'+indices.map(i=>'<span class="jp-line">'+esc(p.jp[i])+'</span>').join('')+'</div><div class="reading reading-aid" lang="ja">'+esc(indices.map(i=>p.kana[i]).join('　'))+'</div>';}
function openPoem(id,scope='all'){currentId=id;studyScope=scope;$('#studyPool').value=scope;revealed=false;setView('study');}
function renderStudy(){const pool=getPool(studyScope);$('#studyPool').value=studyScope;$('#kanaToggle').checked=memory.kana;$('#studyContent').classList.toggle('no-kana',!memory.kana);if(!pool.length){renderStarters();$('#studyContent').innerHTML='<div class="empty"><p>'+({favorites:'还没有收藏。先在学习手帖中收藏喜欢的诗。',review:'目前没有错题。开始一轮练习，检验记忆。',unlearned:'一百首都已标记记住。再练一轮巩固吧。'}[studyScope]||'这个范围还没有诗歌。')+'</p><button class="btn" id="emptyToStarter">学习七张一字决</button></div>';$('#emptyToStarter').onclick=()=>openPoem(87,'starter');return;}if(!pool.some(p=>p.id===currentId)){currentId=pool[0].id;revealed=false;stopAudio();}renderStarters();const p=byId.get(currentId),index=pool.findIndex(p=>p.id===currentId),fav=memory.favorites.includes(p.id),learned=memory.learned.includes(p.id);
 $('#studyContent').innerHTML='<div class="study-board"><div class="reading-panel"><div class="poem-meta"><span class="poem-number">'+String(p.id).padStart(2,'0')+'</span><span lang="ja">'+esc(p.author)+'</span></div><div class="jp-lines">'+lineMarkup(p,[0,1,2])+'</div><div class="kimariji-line"><span>初始决字</span><strong class="kimariji" lang="ja">'+esc(p.kimariji)+'</strong><span>'+Array.from(p.kimariji).length+' 字决</span></div><button class="sound-button" id="speakUpper"><span class="sound-icon" aria-hidden="true">♪</span>朗读上句</button></div><div class="taking-panel"><span class="panel-label">取札 / 下句</span>'+(revealed?cardMarkup(p):'<div class="karuta"><span class="card-hidden">想起哪张札？</span></div>')+'<span class="hint-under">'+(revealed?'传统假名 · 取札式样':'回想下句，再揭晓答案')+'</span></div></div><div class="study-actions"><div class="action-group"><button class="btn primary" id="reveal">'+(revealed?(learned?'已记住 ✓':'记住了 ✓'):'揭晓下句')+'</button><button class="btn" id="favorite" aria-pressed="'+fav+'">'+(fav?'已收藏':'收藏')+'</button>'+(revealed?'<button class="btn small" id="hideAnswer">收起</button>':'')+'</div><div class="paging"><button class="arrow" id="previous" aria-label="上一首" '+(index===0?'disabled':'')+'>←</button><span>'+(index+1)+' / '+pool.length+'</span><button class="arrow" id="next" aria-label="下一首" '+(index===pool.length-1?'disabled':'')+'>→</button></div></div>'+(revealed?'<div class="explanation"><div><h3>下句原文 / 读音</h3><p lang="ja">'+esc(p.jp.slice(3).join('　'))+'</p>'+(memory.kana?'<p class="lower-reading" lang="ja">'+esc(p.kana.slice(3).join('　'))+'</p>':'')+'</div><div><h3>中文意译</h3><p>'+esc(p.meaning)+'</p></div></div>':'')+(revealed&&p.note?'<p class="notice">读音提示：'+esc(p.note)+'</p>':'')+'<p class="notice">♪ 设备日语合成语音，仅作辅助记忆。</p>';
 $('#reveal').onclick=()=>{if(!revealed){revealed=true;renderStudy();$('#reveal').focus();}else{toggleRecord('learned',p.id);notify(memory.learned.includes(p.id)?'已标记记住，可继续下一首。':'已取消“记住”标记。');renderStudy();if($('#reveal'))$('#reveal').focus();}};
 $('#favorite').onclick=()=>{toggleRecord('favorites',p.id);renderStudy();if($('#favorite'))$('#favorite').focus();};
 if($('#hideAnswer'))$('#hideAnswer').onclick=()=>{revealed=false;renderStudy();$('#reveal').focus();};
 $('#speakUpper').onclick=()=>speak(p.kana.slice(0,3).join('、'));
 $('#previous').onclick=()=>stepStudy(-1);$('#next').onclick=()=>stepStudy(1);
}
function stepStudy(d){const pool=getPool(studyScope),i=pool.findIndex(p=>p.id===currentId),next=pool[i+d];if(next){stopAudio();currentId=next.id;revealed=false;renderStudy();const target=$(d>0?'#next':'#previous');if(!target.disabled)target.focus();else $('#reveal').focus();}}
function renderStarters(){$('#starterChips').innerHTML=STARTERS.map(id=>'<button class="starter-chip '+(memory.learned.includes(id)?'learned':'')+'" data-id="'+id+'" aria-label="学习第'+id+'首，决字'+esc(byId.get(id).kimariji)+'" aria-pressed="'+(id===currentId)+'" lang="ja">'+esc(byId.get(id).kimariji)+'</button>').join('');for(const b of $$('#starterChips button'))b.onclick=()=>{openPoem(Number(b.dataset.id),'starter');};}
function renderCatalog(){const q=$('#search').value.trim().toLowerCase(),length=$('#lengthFilter').value,status=$('#statusFilter').value;const found=getPool(status).filter(p=>(length==='all'||Array.from(p.kimariji).length===Number(length))&&(!q||[p.id,p.author,...p.jp,...p.kana,...(p.historical||[]),p.meaning,p.kimariji].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(q)));$('#searchCount').textContent=found.length+' / 100 首 · 点击诗歌进入学习';$('#catalog').innerHTML=found.length?found.map(p=>'<button class="poem-item" data-id="'+p.id+'"><span class="item-number">'+String(p.id).padStart(2,'0')+'</span><span><span class="item-title" lang="ja">'+esc(p.jp[0])+'</span><span class="item-meta"><span lang="ja">'+esc(p.author)+'</span><span class="item-key" lang="ja">'+esc(p.kimariji)+'</span><span>'+p.kimariji.length+'字决</span></span></span><span class="item-status" aria-label="'+(memory.learned.includes(p.id)?'已记住':memory.favorites.includes(p.id)?'已收藏':'未标记')+'">'+(memory.learned.includes(p.id)?'✓':memory.favorites.includes(p.id)?'☆':'↗')+'</span></button>').join(''):'<div class="empty">没有匹配的诗歌，请换一个关键词或筛选条件。</div>';for(const b of $$('#catalog button'))b.onclick=()=>openPoem(Number(b.dataset.id));}
let voices=[];function refreshVoices(){if('speechSynthesis'in window)voices=window.speechSynthesis.getVoices().filter(v=>/^ja(?:-|_|$)/i.test(v.lang));}if('speechSynthesis'in window){refreshVoices();window.speechSynthesis.addEventListener('voiceschanged',refreshVoices);}
function speak(text){refreshVoices();if(!('speechSynthesis'in window)||!voices.length){notify('当前设备未提供日语语音；请使用假名文字练习。');return false;}stopAudio();const utterance=new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);utterance.lang='ja-JP';utterance.voice=voices[0];utterance.rate=.78;utterance.onerror=e=>{if(!['canceled','interrupted'].includes(e.error))notify('语音未能播放，请使用文字练习。');};window.speechSynthesis.speak(utterance);return true;}
function shuffle(arr){const a=[...arr];for(let i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[a[i],a[j]]=[a[j],a[i]];}return a;}
function renderPracticeConfig(preset='starter',mode='key'){document.body.classList.remove('is-quizzing');$('#practiceContent').innerHTML='<div class="practice-config"><label class="config-field">练习范围<select class="select" id="quizPool"><option value="starter">七张一字决 · 建议从这里开始</option><option value="all">完整百首</option><option value="favorites">我的收藏</option><option value="review">错题复习</option></select></label><label class="config-field">题目形式<select class="select" id="quizMode"><option value="key">决字 → 下句</option><option value="upper">上句 → 下句</option><option value="audio">听上句 → 下句</option></select></label><div class="start-row"><p class="muted" style="font-size:12px" id="poolDescription"></p><button class="btn primary" id="startQuiz">开始练习 →</button></div></div><div class="practice-intro"><div><strong>01 · 看</strong><p>认出开头，回想对应下句。</p></div><div><strong>02 · 选</strong><p>从取札中选出答案，无时间限制。</p></div><div><strong>03 · 复习</strong><p>错题留下，下次再记一遍。</p></div></div><p class="notice">本页为配对记忆练习；听音使用设备合成语音，不模拟正式竞技读唱。</p>';$('#quizPool').value=preset;$('#quizMode').value=mode;const update=()=>{const count=getPool($('#quizPool').value).length;$('#poolDescription').textContent=count===0?'此范围暂无诗歌，请先收藏或选择其他范围。':'本范围 '+count+' 首 · 本轮 '+Math.min(10,count)+' 题'+(count<4?' · 选项从百首补足 4 张':' · 每题 4 个选项');$('#startQuiz').disabled=count===0;};$('#quizPool').onchange=update;$('#startQuiz').onclick=startQuiz;update();}
function startQuiz(){document.body.classList.add('is-quizzing');const scope=$('#quizPool').value,pool=getPool(scope),mode=$('#quizMode').value;if(!pool.length)return;quiz={scope,pool,mode,questions:shuffle(pool).slice(0,10),index:0,correct:0,wrong:[],answer:null,showText:false};prepareQuestion();}
function prepareQuestion(){stopAudio();const p=quiz.questions[quiz.index];quiz.answer=null;quiz.showText=false;const distractors=shuffle(quiz.pool.filter(x=>x.id!==p.id));if(distractors.length<3)distractors.push(...shuffle(poems.filter(x=>x.id!==p.id&&!distractors.some(d=>d.id===x.id))).slice(0,3-distractors.length));quiz.options=shuffle([p,...distractors.slice(0,3)]);renderQuiz();$('#quizCounter').focus();}
function renderQuiz(){const q=quiz,p=q.questions[q.index],answered=q.answer!==null,wasRight=q.answer===p.id;let prompt=q.mode==='key'?'<div class="prompt-text prompt-key" lang="ja">'+esc(p.kimariji)+'</div>':q.mode==='upper'||q.showText?'<div class="prompt-text" lang="ja">'+esc(p.kana.slice(0,3).join('　'))+'</div>':'<div class="prompt-text">听声音，找下句。</div>';
 $('#practiceContent').innerHTML='<div class="quiz-head"><span id="quizCounter" tabindex="-1">第 '+(q.index+1)+' / '+q.questions.length+' 题</span><button class="little-action" id="exitQuiz">结束本轮</button></div><div class="quiz-prompt"><span class="eyebrow">'+({key:'初始决字',upper:'上句读音',audio:'设备日语合成语音'}[q.mode])+'</span>'+prompt+(q.mode==='audio'?'<div class="action-group"><button class="btn small" id="playQuestion">♪ '+(answered?'再听一次':'播放上句')+'</button><button class="little-action" id="showQuestion">'+(q.showText?'隐藏文字':'显示文字')+'</button></div>':'')+'</div><div class="answers" role="group" aria-label="选择对应的下句">'+q.options.map((o,i)=>'<button class="answer '+(answered?(o.id===p.id?'correct':o.id===q.answer?'incorrect':''):'')+'" data-id="'+o.id+'" aria-label="选项'+(i+1)+'，'+esc((o.historical||o.kana).slice(3).join(''))+'" '+(answered?'disabled':'')+'>'+cardMarkup(o)+'<span class="answer-label">'+(answered&&o.id===p.id?'✓ 正确答案':answered&&o.id===q.answer?'× 你的选择':'选项 '+(i+1))+'</span></button>').join('')+'</div>'+(answered?'<div class="feedback '+(wasRight?'':'error')+'" role="status"><strong>'+(wasRight?'回答正确':'再记一次：'+p.kimariji+' → '+(p.historical||p.kana)[3])+'</strong><p>'+esc(p.author)+' · 第 '+p.id+' 首</p><p>'+esc(p.meaning)+'</p></div><div class="quiz-footer"><span class="muted" style="font-size:12px">'+(wasRight?'本轮已答对 '+q.correct+' 题':'已加入错题复习')+'</span><button class="btn primary" id="nextQuestion">'+(q.index+1===q.questions.length?'查看结果':'下一题 →')+'</button></div>':'<p class="notice">点击取札作答；桌面也可以按数字键 1–'+q.options.length+'。</p>');
 for(const b of $$('.answer'))b.onclick=()=>answerQuiz(Number(b.dataset.id));$('#exitQuiz').onclick=()=>{stopAudio();renderResult(true);};if($('#playQuestion'))$('#playQuestion').onclick=()=>{if(!speak(p.kana.slice(0,3).join('、'))){q.showText=true;renderQuiz();$('#showQuestion').focus();}};if($('#showQuestion'))$('#showQuestion').onclick=()=>{q.showText=!q.showText;renderQuiz();$('#showQuestion').focus();};if($('#nextQuestion'))$('#nextQuestion').onclick=()=>{if(q.index+1===q.questions.length){stopAudio();renderResult(false);}else{q.index++;prepareQuestion();}};
}
function answerQuiz(id){if(!quiz||quiz.answer!==null)return;stopAudio();const p=quiz.questions[quiz.index];quiz.answer=id;if(id===p.id){quiz.correct++;memory.review=memory.review.filter(n=>n!==p.id);}else{quiz.wrong.push(p.id);if(!memory.review.includes(p.id))memory.review.push(p.id);}save();renderQuiz();$('#nextQuestion').focus();}
function renderResult(early){document.body.classList.remove('is-quizzing');const q=quiz,completed=q.index+(q.answer!==null?1:0),wrongIds=[...q.wrong],scope=q.scope,mode=q.mode;quiz=null;$('#practiceContent').innerHTML='<div class="result"><span class="eyebrow">'+(early?'本轮已结束':'本轮练习完成')+'</span><div class="result-score">'+q.correct+' <span style="font-size:28px;color:var(--muted)">/ '+completed+'</span></div><h2>'+(completed===0?'准备好了，再开始。':q.correct===completed?'全部答对':'练习结果')+'</h2><p class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:12px">'+(completed===0?'本轮没有作答。':wrongIds.length?'本轮 '+wrongIds.length+' 首已加入错题复习。':'本轮无错题。可以扩大范围继续练习。')+'</p><div class="result-actions"><button class="btn primary" id="againQuiz">再练一轮</button><button class="btn" id="backToStudy">回到学习</button></div>'+(wrongIds.length?'<div class="wrong-list">'+wrongIds.map(id=>{const p=byId.get(id);return '<button data-id="'+id+'"><span lang="ja">'+esc(p.kimariji)+' → '+esc((p.historical||p.kana)[3])+'</span><span>复习 ↗</span></button>';}).join('')+'</div>':'')+'</div>';$('#againQuiz').onclick=()=>renderPracticeConfig(scope,mode);$('#backToStudy').onclick=()=>setView('study');for(const b of $$('.wrong-list button'))b.onclick=()=>openPoem(Number(b.dataset.id),'review');$('#againQuiz').focus();}
for(const b of $$('.nav button'))b.onclick=()=>setView(b.dataset.view);for(const b of $$('[data-go]'))b.onclick=()=>setView(b.dataset.go);
$('#studyPool').onchange=e=>{studyScope=e.target.value;currentId=getPool(studyScope)[0]?.id||87;revealed=false;renderStudy();};$('#kanaToggle').onchange=e=>{memory.kana=e.target.checked;save();renderStudy();};
$('#search').oninput=renderCatalog;$('#lengthFilter').onchange=renderCatalog;$('#statusFilter').onchange=renderCatalog;$('#practiceStarter').onclick=()=>{setView('practice');renderPracticeConfig('starter');};$('#guideStart').onclick=()=>openPoem(87,'starter');
$('#exportProgress').onclick=()=>{const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify({app:STORE,version:1,exportedAt:new Date().toISOString(),state:memory},null,2)],{type:'application/json'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='karuta-progress.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),500);notify('已导出学习记录。');};$('#importProgress').onclick=()=>$('#importFile').click();
$('#importFile').onchange=async e=>{const file=e.target.files[0];if(!file)return;try{if(file.size>200000)throw Error();const data=JSON.parse(await file.text());if(data.app!==STORE||data.version!==1||!data.state||typeof data.state!=='object'||['learned','favorites','review'].some(k=>!Array.isArray(data.state[k])))throw Error();const imported=cleanState(data.state);for(const key of ['learned','favorites','review'])memory[key]=[...new Set([...memory[key],...imported[key]])];save();notify('已合并导入学习记录。');}catch{notify('文件无法识别，请选择本页导出的 JSON 记录。');}e.target.value='';};
$('#resetProgress').onclick=()=>{if(window.confirm('清空当前浏览器的收藏、已记住和错题记录？此操作无法撤销，建议先导出备份。')){memory=cleanState(null);save();notify('学习记录已清空。');}};
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(/INPUT|SELECT|TEXTAREA/.test(e.target.tagName)||e.altKey||e.metaKey||e.ctrlKey)return;if(currentView==='practice'&&quiz&&quiz.answer===null&&/^[1-4]$/.test(e.key)){const option=quiz.options[Number(e.key)-1];if(option){e.preventDefault();answerQuiz(option.id);}}});window.addEventListener('pagehide',stopAudio);
const rawSources=JSON.parse($('#sourceData').textContent);const sources=Array.isArray(rawSources)?rawSources:(rawSources.sources||[]);const baseSources=[{title:'全日本かるた協会 · 入门与决字',url:'https://www.karuta.or.jp/karuta/first-time/'},{title:'全日本かるた協会 · 正式规则',url:'https://www.karuta.or.jp/karuta/rule/'},{title:'全日本かるた協会 · 读手教材',url:'https://www.karuta.or.jp/static/kitei/20200425-dokushu-text.pdf'}];const uniqueSources=[...new Map([...baseSources,...sources].filter(s=>typeof s.url==='string'&&/^https:\/\//.test(s.url)).map(s=>[s.url,s])).values()];$('#sourceList').innerHTML=uniqueSources.map(s=>'<li><a href="'+esc(s.url)+'" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">'+esc(s.title||s.name||s.url)+' ↗</a></li>').join('');
$('#storageWarning').hidden=storageOK;updateProgress();renderStudy();
</script>
</body>
</html>
